mindmap
  root(("Troubleshooting & Diagnostics"))
    Tools
      ping
        ICMP echo request/reply
        tests reachability & RTT
      traceroute / tracert
        TTL-based path discovery
        shows hops & latency
      nslookup / dig
        DNS resolution queries
        authoritative vs recursive
      ipconfig / ifconfig
        interface configuration
        IP, MAC, gateway
      netstat / ss
        active connections & ports
        listening services
      nmap
        port scanning
        OS & service detection
      tcpdump / Wireshark
        packet capture & analysis
        deep protocol inspection
    Common Issues
      Connectivity
        No route to host
        DNS resolution failure
        Firewall blocking
      Performance
        High latency / jitter
        Packet loss
        TCP retransmissions
        Bandwidth saturation
      Configuration
        Duplicate IP addresses
        Wrong subnet mask
        MTU mismatch
      Security
        Unauthorized access
        ARP poisoning
        Rogue DHCP server
    Methodology
      OSI Model Approach
        start at Physical
        work up the layers
      Divide & Conquer
        check each layer
        isolate the faulty one
      Follow the Path
        trace end-to-end
        verify each hop
